From 168002f569f6bfc531b7fc6f7a0dab460dee441e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:56:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(web): adapt suites after avatar removal

- delete the auth-avatar, pi-chat-avatar and chat-agent-avatar suites and
  add a chat-agent-label suite covering the runtime -> name mapping
- session list: drop the logo/outline assertions and the ProfileAvatar
  stubs, keep the identity-row and navigation coverage
- chat: assert the author rows still render names and never render
  avatars (MessageItem toggle, highlight, scroll-position, live reasoning)
- kanban: drop the assignee-avatar stubs/assertions from the card and
  view suites
- profiles store / profile card: drop the avatar api mocks and tests
- e2e: drop the /api/auth/avatar fixture and the thinking-avatar
  assertions
